#**************************************************************************************************************
# Filename              : ladisbchrgdp002.scr
# Description           : The script is used to fetch DATA(charge details ) from  custome table for HLADISB
# Input                 :
# Output                :
# Called Script         :
# Calling Script        : NONE
# Modification History
# Sl. #           Date             Author             Modification           Version
# -----          ------           --------          ----------------        ---------
